1
00:00:00,059 --> 00:00:02,200
A revolving door is slower than a normal door,

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,360
more expensive to build, and much harder to

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,159
carry anything through, and tall buildings

4
00:00:06,219 --> 00:00:07,239
keep installing them anyway.

5
00:00:07,579 --> 00:00:09,939
Warm air inside a tall building rises and escapes

6
00:00:09,979 --> 00:00:11,759
out of the top, and that pulls cold air

7
00:00:11,779 --> 00:00:12,739
in hard at street level.

8
00:00:12,979 --> 00:00:13,979
On an ordinary door,

9
00:00:14,299 --> 00:00:15,939
that pressure difference turns the entrance

10
00:00:15,979 --> 00:00:17,879
into a wind tunnel and throws the heating out

11
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:18,520
into the street.

12
00:00:18,799 --> 00:00:20,699
A revolving door never actually opens.

13
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,979
Only the wedge of air in your compartment travels

14
00:00:23,019 --> 00:00:23,619
with you.
